# Shared jobround.ai Supabase project (ref: fhcrxjrqtojixgqemofp)
# Copy to .env.local and fill in the publishable key from the Supabase dashboard.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://fhcrxjrqtojixgqemofp.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# Public Google OAuth web client ID for the One Tap prompt (same client as the
# Supabase Google provider). Optional; defaults to the jobround.ai client.
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# Production origin used for auth redirects on Vercel (custom domain or preview).
# VITE_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://experts.jobround.ai
# Extra origins for Google One Tap (comma-separated), e.g. Vercel preview URLs:
# VITE_GOOGLE_AUTHORIZED_ORIGINS=https://roundone-interviewer.vercel.app
#
# Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client (36438582739-…):
#   Authorized JavaScript origins: each app URL you sign in from, e.g.
#     https://experts.jobround.ai
#     http://localhost:5174
#   Authorized redirect URIs (required for Continue with Google via Supabase):
#     https://fhcrxjrqtojixgqemofp.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#
# Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → URL Configuration (shared with Candidate):
#   Site URL may stay https://jobround.ai for the candidate app.
#   Redirect URLs MUST include the interviewer origin or signup emails open Candidate:
#     https://experts.jobround.ai/**
#     https://jobround.ai/**
#     http://localhost:5174/**
#     http://localhost:5173/**
# Interviewer confirmation and password-reset emails use:
#   https://experts.jobround.ai/interviewer/auth/callback
#   https://experts.jobround.ai/interviewer/reset-password
# Supabase must have SMTP configured (Authentication → Email) for messages to send.
